Multiplies an integer by nine, by tripling it twice. The import is named by a plain file name, so triple.prog is found in this folder, next to this file, and not in the folder of the program that imports ninefold.
---
triple = triple.prog
---
(lam x (triple (triple x)))
---
1 => 9 fuel 10000
-3 => -27 fuel 10000
